7613013887060","CIHM0ogKEIDu_779obaiqAE","CgwI3e3G0wYQ2IjzugI"]],[null,[[["各位不好意思。7/11星期六和7/12星期日要公休兩天！\n柳町家大部分的食材都是要處理一天以上，肉、湯、蛋..等都是。例如「肉」都是前一天要處理好醃製，第二天才能烹調。\n本來打算是星期五回來醃製，星期六日就可以營業，不過星期五六颱風天許多廠商沒有送貨。\n為了安全，星期六颱風天不營業。星期天的部分因為沒有食材也沒辦法營業了。\n目前預計下星期二推出「夏季限定」，我們會珍惜因為颱風假多出來的時間來積極準備「夏季限定」！",1]]],[1783697517,1799508717],null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipNXFxJirBD2dA7q-umgB21BIEedVPhDV9u20JqJ\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipNXFxJirBD2dA7q-umgB21BIEedVPhDV9u20JqJ"]],"5758931131124914982","11231923109542534561",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003da03de85e817154d0\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003dzh-TW\u0026gl\u003dtw\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003d%E6%9F%B3%E7%94%BA%E5%AE%B6%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5\u0026ludocid\u003d1037899390242872082\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEMS1xZSFn7zzzAE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEMS1xZSFn7zzzAE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F11231923109542534561%2FlocalPosts%2F5758931131124914982/version/1783853716058000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCKa2jqWgq_X1TxIXQ0lITTBvZ0tFTVMxeFpTRm43enp6QUUaE0Nnd0lsT1hOMGdZUXFPenIzUUk\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003d%E6%9F%B3%E7%94%BA%E5%AE%B6%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5\u0026ludocid\u003d1037899390242872082\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEMS1xZSFn7zzzAE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5WdvNhjBKSkLdfR7XpoayHl","0ahUKEwi3gMLVuteWAxXTk68BHf5IDWkQ544CCJYBKB0",null,"2026年7月10日",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u11231923109542534561/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM1NzU4OTMxMTMxMTI0OTE0OTgy","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u11231923109542534561/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM1NzU4OTMxMTMxMTI0OTE0OTgy",null,null,null,null,null,["5758931131124914982","CIHM0ogKEMS1xZSFn7zzzAE","CgwIlOXN0gYQqOzr3QI"]],[null,[[["2026.7月營業公告🪧\n\n本月的公休日期：\n\n7/5～7/10、7/13、7/20～7/22、7/27\n\n7月雞白湯暫停販售呦🙏🏻\n————\n\n🍊每碗麵