白湯 來的 詢問後得知 近兩個月都不會有，工作人員不多，會需要花時間等候餐點，但都很親切。( 2026.7.4 )",null,[0,53]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11231923109542534561/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPYmxOV1pGSlVhMFpQVTBSQ1UxSkhVbGxTYlU1WVVsaHJlVmxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11231923109542534561/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPYmxOV1pGSlVhMFpQVTBSQ1UxSkhVbGxTYlU1WVVsaHJlVmxzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11231923109542534561/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPYmxOV1pGSlVhMFpQVTBSQ1UxSkhVbGxTYlU1WVVsaHJlVmxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11231923109542534561/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPYmxOV1pGSlVhMFpQVTBSQ1UxSkhVbGxTYlU1WVVsaHJlVmxzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11231923109542534561/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPYmxOV1pGSlVhMFpQVTBSQ1UxSkhVbGxTYlU1WVVsaHJlVmxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11231923109542534561/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPYmxOV1pGSlVhMFpQVTBSQ1UxSkhVbGxTYlU1WVVsaHJlVmxzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2414,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOblNWZFJUa0ZPU0RCU1JHUllSbU5YUlhreVlsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xe675bff14055b12!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkNnSVdRTkFOSDBSRGRYRmNXRXkyYlE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOblNWZFJUa0ZPU0RCU1JHUllSbU5YUlhreVlsRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOblNWZFJUa0ZPU0RCU1JHUllSbU5YUlhreVlsRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOblNWZFJUa0ZPU0RCU1JHUllSbU5YUlhreVlsRRILMGVPRVBoM29zOEkaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rTm5TVmRSVGtGT1NEQlNSR1JZUm1OWFJYa3lZbEUSCzBlT0VQaDNvczhJIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARElsFFP9bZw4qCzBlT0VQaDNvczhJ\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null